---
layout: default
page_class: homepage
title: Home
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Cloud Strategist &amp; Software Architect</span>
    <h1>Modernize the Enterprise</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Tap into thoughtful advice and expertise from leading cloud strategist Lee Atchison.</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">Organizations need modern applications, processes, and tools to compete. Without reliable digital services, customers will leave.</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Work with Lee</a>
      <a href="/#insights" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Resources</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%
  spotlight_books   = site.collections["books"].resources
                        .select { |b| b.data.spotlight_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |b| b.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }
  spotlight_courses = site.collections["courses"].resources
                        .select { |c| c.data.spotlight_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |c| c.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }

  featured_courses  = site.collections["courses"].resources
                        .select { |c| c.data.feature_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |c| c.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }
%>

<% unless spotlight_books.empty? && spotlight_courses.empty? %>
<section class="whats-new">
  <div class="whats-new-inner">
    <% spotlight_books.each do |book| %>
      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url book.data.cover_image %>"
               alt="<%= book.data.title %> book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <% if book.data.badge %>
            <span class="book-tag book-tag--<%= book.data.badge_style || 'new' %>"><%= book.data.badge %></span>
          <% end %>
          <h3><%= book.data.title %></h3>
          <p class="book-authors"><%= book.data.authors.join(", ") %></p>
          <p><%= book.data.summary %></p>
          <a href="<%= relative_url book.relative_url %>" class="book-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% end %>
    <div class="whats-new-content">
      <span class="section-label">What's New</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What's New from Lee</h2>
      <div class="home-courses-grid">
        <% spotlight_courses.each do |course| %>
          <a href="<%= relative_url course.relative_url %>" class="course-card">
            <% if course.data.availability == "prelaunch" %>
              <span class="course-card-platform course-platform-badge--prelaunch">Coming Soon</span>
            <% else %>
              <span class="course-card-platform"><%= course.data.platform %></span>
            <% end %>
            <h3><%= course.data.title %></h3>
            <p><%= course.data.summary %></p>
            <span class="course-card-link">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<% end %>

<section class="pillars">
  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Scalable &amp; Agile</h3>
      <p>Scalable applications and agile business adaptation to stay ahead in a fast-moving market.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Cost-Effective Operations</h3>
      <p>Efficient, cost-effective operations that deliver results without bloated infrastructure costs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Managed Risk</h3>
      <p>Manageable risk and technical debt so you can move fast without breaking critical systems.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-photo-block">
      <div class="about-photo-circle">
        <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/lee-atchison.png' %>" alt="Lee Atchison" />
      </div>
      <div class="about-credentials">
        <span class="credential-badge">Software Architect</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Published Author</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Public Speaker</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Fractional Chief Architect</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <span class="section-label">About Lee</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three Decades of Industry-Shaping Experience</h2>
      <p>Lee Atchison is a software architect, published author, and public speaker specializing in cloud computing and application modernization. With over three decades of experience, Lee has worked with some of the world&rsquo;s most innovative technology companies.</p>
      <p>As a recognized thought leader, Lee shares expertise through books, columns, blogs, and speaking engagements &mdash; and works directly with organizations as a Fractional Chief Architect consultant across multiple industries.</p>
      <div class="about-companies">
        <span class="company-tag">Amazon.com</span>
        <span class="company-tag">AWS</span>
        <span class="company-tag">New Relic</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="books" id="books">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">Published Works</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Books by Lee Atchison</h2>
      <p>Practical guides for architects and technology leaders navigating modern software challenges.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="books-grid">

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/books/the-software-conductor.png' %>"
               alt="The Software Conductor book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <span class="book-tag book-tag--new">New Release</span>
          <h3>The Software Conductor</h3>
          <p class="book-authors">Lee Atchison</p>
          <p>A journey of discovery from software developer to architect. Designing systems. Leading teams. Creating harmony.</p>
          <a href="https://thesoftwareconductor.com" class="book-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/books/business-breakthrough-3.jpg' %>"
               alt="Business Breakthrough 3.0 book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <span class="book-tag book-tag--collab">Co-Authored</span>
          <h3>Business Breakthrough 3.0</h3>
          <p class="book-authors">with Ken Gavranovic</p>
          <p>A five-step process that fuels engagement, boosts agility, and drives lasting change in your organization.</p>
          <a href="https://businessbreakthrough30.com" class="book-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/books/architecting-for-scale.jpg' %>"
               alt="Architecting for Scale book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <span class="book-tag book-tag--oreilly">O&rsquo;Reilly Media</span>
          <h3>Architecting for Scale</h3>
          <p class="book-authors">Lee Atchison</p>
          <p>How to maintain high availability and manage risk in the cloud. An essential resource for technical teams worldwide.</p>
          <a href="https://architectingforscale.com" class="book-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/books/overcoming-it-complexity.png' %>"
               alt="Overcoming IT Complexity book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <span class="book-tag book-tag--oreilly">O&rsquo;Reilly Media</span>
          <h3>Overcoming IT Complexity</h3>
          <p class="book-authors">Lee Atchison</p>
          <p>Simplify operations, enable innovation, and cultivate successful cloud outcomes by taming IT complexity.</p>
          <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Overcoming-Complexity-Lee-Atchison-ebook/dp/B0BPN73PKN?tag=leeatchison-20" class="book-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="courses" id="courses">
  <div class="courses-inner">
    <div class="courses-stat">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">180,000+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">learners have taken Lee&rsquo;s courses</span>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <p class="stat-desc">Professionals across the globe learn cloud architecture, scalability, and modern software design from Lee&rsquo;s courses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="courses-content">
      <span class="section-label">Training &amp; Education</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Learn from a Master Architect</h2>
      <p class="courses-desc">Lee&rsquo;s courses reach professionals across the globe through leading learning platforms, covering software architecture, cloud computing, and more.</p>
      <div class="home-courses-grid">
        <% featured_courses.each do |course| %>
          <a href="<%= relative_url course.relative_url %>" class="course-card">
            <% if course.data.availability == "prelaunch" %>
              <span class="course-card-platform course-platform-badge--prelaunch">Coming Soon</span>
            <% else %>
              <span class="course-card-platform"><%= course.data.platform %></span>
            <% end %>
            <h3><%= course.data.title %></h3>
            <p><%= course.data.summary %></p>
            <span class="course-card-link">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-group ain-btn-group-left">
        <a href="<%= relative_url '/courses' %>" class="btn btn-outline">View All Courses &rarr;</a>
        <a href="https://atchisonacademy.com" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the Academy &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="insights" id="insights">
  <div class="section-inner insights-inner">
    <div class="insights-logo">
      <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/sai-logo.png' %>" alt="Software Architecture Insights" />
    </div>
    <span class="section-label">Knowledge Hub</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Software Architecture Insights</h2>
    <p class="insights-desc">A curated resource for software architects and aspiring professionals covering cloud computing, application security, scalability, and high availability.</p>
    <div class="insights-topics">
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/ainative' %>" class="topic-tag topic-tag--link">AI-Native</a>
      <span class="topic-tag">Cloud Computing</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Application Security</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Scalability</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">High Availability</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Modern Architecture</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Tech Leadership</span>
    </div>
    <a href="https://softwarearchitectureinsights.com" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the Article Library</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="contact-inner">
    <div class="contact-text">
      <span class="section-label">Work with Lee</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ready to Modernize Your Organization?</h2>
      <ul class="services-list">
        <li>Cloud modernization consulting and strategy</li>
        <li>Fractional Chief Architect services</li>
        <li>Architecture review and assessment</li>
        <li>Team mentoring and enablement</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-methods">
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/contact' %>" class="contact-method">
        <div class="contact-method-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Send a Message</strong>
          <span>Use the contact form to reach Lee</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/leeatchison" class="contact-method">
        <div class="contact-method-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>LinkedIn</strong>
          <span>Connect and message on LinkedIn</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>